Vector XL Driver Library
------------------------

The optional `cand-relay-backend-vector` crate interoperates with Vector
Informatik GmbH's XL Driver Library (vxlapi.h, vxlapi64.dll / libxlapi.so).
None of the XL Driver Library is included in this repository; it must be
obtained from Vector and is subject to Vector's license terms. FFI bindings
are generated at build time from the user's local copy of vxlapi.h.

socketcand
----------

cand-relay implements the socketcand network protocol for interoperability.
It does not contain code from the socketcand project.

